@startuml system_architecture_request_lifecycle_flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowout false

skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 140

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
    ArrowColor #475569
    ArrowFontSize 10
}

skinparam activityDiamond {
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    BorderColor #D97706
    FontColor #92400E
}

title **Modern Laravel Blog - End-to-End System Architecture & Request Lifecycle Flow**

|#EFF6FF|Client Browser (Tailwind & Alpine)|
|#F0FDF4|Docker Container & Web Server|
|#FEFCE8|Laravel 13 Kernel & Middleware|
|#FAF5FF|Routing, Policies & Controllers|
|#F1F5F9|Eloquent ORM & SQLite Database|

|Client Browser (Tailwind & Alpine)|
start
:User initiates HTTP Request\n(browse blog, filter categories, submit post, login);

|Docker Container & Web Server|
:Docker Container binds port **8000** to host;
:PHP Development Server receives request;
:Route request to **public/index.php**;

|Laravel 13 Kernel & Middleware|
:Bootstrap Laravel Application (**bootstrap/app.php**);
:Register Service Providers:
- **AppServiceProvider** sets:
  ""Model::preventLazyLoading(! app()->isProduction())""
- Storage & Cache bindings configured;

:Execute Global & Web Middleware Pipeline:
1. **EncryptCookies**
2. **AddQueuedCookiesToResponse**
3. **StartSession** (reads/writes SQLite **sessions** table)
4. **ShareErrorsFromSession**
5. **VerifyCsrfToken** (protects POST/PUT/DELETE requests);

|Routing, Policies & Controllers|
:Match request against **routes/web.php** and **routes/auth.php**;

if (Route Type?) then (Public Blog Route)
    :Route: **GET /** or **GET /posts/{post:slug}**;
    :Invoke **PostController@index** or **PostController@show**;

    |Eloquent ORM & SQLite Database|
    :Query **posts** table with eager loading:
    ""Post::with(['author', 'category'])->latest()->filter($filters)"";
    :Execute queries on SQLite database (**database/database.sqlite**);
    :Query **categories** table with post counts;

    |Routing, Policies & Controllers|
    :Compile Component Tree without traditional @extends inheritance:
    - **<x-public-layout>**
      - **<x-navbar>** (Interactive Alpine.js dropdown & drawer)
      - **<x-search-bar>** (Filter pills, search input)
      - **<x-post-card>** (Category **<x-badge>**, author metadata);

else if (Route Type?) then (Authentication Route)
    :Route: **login**, **register**, or **logout**;
    :Invoke Laravel Breeze Controllers & **LoginRequest**;

    |Eloquent ORM & SQLite Database|
    :Query SQLite **cache** table for Rate Limiter checks;
    :Query **users** table for credentials / registration;
    :Update **sessions** table on authentication;

    |Routing, Policies & Controllers|
    :Compile Auth Views (**<x-guest-layout>**);

else (Protected Dashboard Route)
    |Laravel 13 Kernel & Middleware|
    :Verify **Authenticate** & **EnsureEmailIsVerified** middleware;
    if (User is Authenticated?) then (no)
        |Routing, Policies & Controllers|
        :Redirect to **login** route; <<#FEE2E2>>
        stop
    else (yes)
        |Routing, Policies & Controllers|
        :Route: **/dashboard/posts/*** or **/profile**;
        :Invoke **Gate::authorize()** invoking **PostPolicy**;
        
        if (User satisfies Policy conditions?) then (no)
            :Abort with **403 Forbidden**; <<#FEE2E2>>
            stop
        else (yes)
            :Invoke **DashboardPostController** CRUD method;
            |Eloquent ORM & SQLite Database|
            :Read/Write to **posts** table;
            :Manage media on **Storage::disk('public')**\n(Mapped to **public/storage/posts**);
            |Routing, Policies & Controllers|
            :Compile Dashboard Views (**<x-app-layout>**):
            - Dashboard Table with pagination
            - Create/Edit forms with Alpine.js real-time slug generator
            - Alpine.js delete confirmation modal dialog;
        endif
    endif
endif

|Docker Container & Web Server|
:Generate HTTP Response with compiled HTML, headers, and session cookies;

|Client Browser (Tailwind & Alpine)|
:Browser parses HTML, loads compiled Tailwind CSS & JS bundles;
:Initialize Alpine.js reactive components:
- Mobile drawer toggles
- User dropdown menus
- Real-time slug auto-generation from title
- Live file upload thumbnail previews
- Delete confirmation modal with backdrop transitions
- Auto-dismissing flash notification alerts;

:Fully responsive, interactive page rendered for user; <<#DCFCE7>>
stop

@enduml
